                                                "sense_id": "4df3d2a1-8798-33da-b339-700291aa9f27",
                                                "text": "Altogether, the present data show that the Toxoplasma-induced hypermigratory phenotype in a 3D matrix is consistent with integrin-independent amoeboid DC migration with maintained responsiveness to chemotactic and chemokinetic cues."
